{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-35","kind":"proposition","title":"同底同高平行四边形面积相等","englishTitle":"Parallelograms which are on the same base and in the same parallels are equal to one another.","book":1,"number":35,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.35","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.35/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":35,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","contentId":"euclid-1-35","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b09a7d5f50fadbfdb0ce91d94deb363af16e2bf1cbf226e41402bdd033427ebb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-35.statement","euclid-1-35.construction.1","euclid-1-35.proof.1","euclid-1-35.proof.2","euclid-1-35.proof.3","euclid-1-35.construction.2","euclid-1-35.construction.3","euclid-1-35.proof.4","euclid-1-35.conclusion","euclid-1-35.historical.1","euclid-1-35.historical.2","euclid-1-35.historical.3","euclid-1-35.historical.4","euclid-1-35.historical.5","euclid-1-35.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-35.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dba669c0f2a02b0a9907573c6285ed36b60726024f744ddd009fc20625d33a1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Parallelograms which are on the same base and in the same parallels are equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行四边形个相同底边个平行的,彼此平等。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行方形若同在平行线内又同底则两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平行四边形都在平行线内且有相同的底，那么这两个形状必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b6083ce4095968294c43de7c7da9fe50b1658430f64bf8edb05f7bf9abca4cc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD, EBCF be parallelograms on the same base BC and in the same parallels AF, BC; I say that ABCD is equal to the parallelogram EBCF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD,EBCF,平行四边形在相同的底边,BC和同样的AF,BC;我说,ABCD等于平行四边形,EBCF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c455053f765b8fc1aa700ac5184369ec1213a622fa215af71f2e80677a123606","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since ABCD is a parallelogram, AD is equal to BC. [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,ABCD是平行四边形,AD等于BC。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1795228bc171d31d57a3cae91baf235719c664d3a5413d84378a41c17ca8bde6","citations":["euclid-1-cn-1","euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also EF is equal to BC, so that AD is also equal to EF; [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] and DE is common; therefore the whole AE is equal to the whole DF. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,EF等于BC,AD等于EF,DE为普通人,因此,整个AE等于整个DF。 [[C.N. 1](/principles/euclid-1-cn-1)] [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21ddd29a4c9822cf165550a39bde0ed65058c7656797c2eb3f2c16ff78ddff48","citations":["euclid-1-34","euclid-1-29","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB is also equal to DC; [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore the two sides EA, AB are equal to the two sides FD, DC respectively, and the angle FDC is equal to the angle EAB, the exterior to the interior; [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] therefore the base EB is equal to the base FC, and the triangle EAB will be equal to the triangle FDC. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB也等于DC;因此,双方EA、AB等于双方FD、DC,FDC角等于角EAB,内外部AB,EB等于底边,FC,三角形EAB等于三角形FDC。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dc835208e5882193146ace4d07b738ab5f8a62263ed201650f3b3f1a8cb8beed","citations":["euclid-1-cn-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let DGE be subtracted from each; therefore the trapezium ABGD which remains is equal to the trapezium EGCF which remains. [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将每只DGE只减掉,因此,剩余的ABGD只等于剩余的EGCF只。 [[C.N. 3](/principles/euclid-1-cn-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db4ef8abbee2a84a8a21349c51c5f4b16d77bf0ec723da1f645d4c53ad57eafc","citations":["euclid-1-cn-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the triangle GBC be added to each; therefore the whole parallelogram ABCD is equal to the whole parallelogram EBCF. [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形GBC加到每个三角形上,因此,整个平行四边形 ABCD等于整个平行四边形 EBCF。 [[C.N. 2](/principles/euclid-1-cn-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63a94e59fe5e2650af769d47705603edede0583628ed71ff593694796f20a723","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行方形若同在平行线内又同底则两形必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个平行四边形都在平行线内且有相同的底，那么这两个形状必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"27991ec9f8cfffa37ba0868912264ec6e79352f65ca0487e9b12d964bde4c741","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两平行线内有丙丁戊甲与丙丁乙巳两平行方形同丙丁底题言此两形等等者不谓腰等角等谓所函之地等后言形等者多仿此"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁，在两条平行线内有平行四边形 丙丁戊甲 和 丙丁乙巳，形状相同。丙丁 基本命题：解释这两个形状：‘相等的形状’不意味着腰相等、角相等，以及其中所含的‘地’相等。以后提到相等形状时，很多都是遵循此模式。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad19671aab24266385a3abcc734dec52d9a31c6b5aa1c70d2be007815e188451","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先论曰：设己在甲戊之内其丙丁戊甲与丙丁乙己皆平行方形丙丁同底则甲戊与丙丁巳乙与丙丁各相对之两边各等〈本篇三四〉而甲戊与己乙亦等〈公论一〉试于甲戊己乙两线各减己戊即甲己与戊乙亦等〈公论三〉而甲丙与戊丁元等〈本篇三四〉乙戊丁外角与己甲丙内角又等〈本篇廿九〉则乙戊丁与己甲丙两角形必等矣〈本篇四〉次于两角形每加一丙丁戊己无法四边形则丙丁戊甲与丙丁乙己两平行方形等也〈公论二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，证明如下：设 己 在 甲戊 内，并且 丙丁戊甲 和 丙丁乙己 都是平行四边形。如果 丙丁 有相同的底，那么 甲戊、丙丁巳乙 和 丙丁 均为对边，其边相等 〈本篇三四〉，并且 甲戊 和 己乙 相等。如果从 甲戊己乙 减去 己戊，则 甲己 和 戊乙 也相等。〈公论三〉 和 戊丁 相等 〈本篇三四〉乙戊丁 外角等于 己甲丙 的内角 〈本篇廿九〉，则三角形 乙戊丁 和 己甲丙 必须相等。〈本篇四〉 位于两个三角形旁边。丙丁戊己 不能形成四边形，因此 丙丁戊甲 和 丙丁乙己 是相等的平行四边形。〈公论二〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":12,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"088c7c222779b65b98f2a1117c9be46c57a6eb8e14e2e86a5d68193609bad71c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"次论曰：设己戊同点依前甲戊与戊乙等乙戊丁与戊甲丙两角形等〈本篇四〉而每加一戊丁丙角形则丙丁戊甲与丙丁乙戊两平行方形必等〈公论二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：设 己戊 为同一点，且三角形 甲戊 和 戊乙 等于 〈本篇四〉，对于每个额外的 戊丁丙 三角形，则平行四边形 丙丁戊甲 和 丙丁乙戊 必须等于 〈公论二〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8447a499dac0476fa27020ed2f785aaa26eaac6eb3ae846c336b3d5ccd0467b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后论曰：设己点在戊之外而丙己与戊丁两线交于庚依前甲戊与己乙两线等而每加一戊己线即戊乙与甲己两线亦等〈公论二〉因显己甲丙与乙戊丁两角形亦等〈本篇四〉次每减一己戊庚角形则所存戊庚丙甲与乙己庚丁两无法四边形亦等〈公论三〉次于两无法形每加一庚丁丙角形则丙丁戊甲与丙丁乙己两平行方形必等〈公论二〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来，证明如下：令点 己 在 戊 之外，且直线 丙己 和 戊丁 交于 庚。根据先前的 甲戊 和 己乙 直线，它们是相等的，并且每个额外的 戊己 直线，即直线 戊乙 和 甲己 也相等。〈公论二〉 显示三角形 己甲丙 和 乙戊丁 也相等。〈本篇四〉 减去一个 己戊庚 三角形，所以剩下的三角形 戊庚丙甲 和 乙己庚丁 也等于 〈公论三〉。每增加一个 庚丁丙 三角形，使 丙丁戊甲 和 丙丁乙己 平行四边形必然等于 〈公论二〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-35.source","contentId":"euclid-1-35","revisionId":"euclid-1-35@raw-b09a7d5f50fadbfd","order":14,"kind":"sour